Name: WebAssembly Binary Toolkit
Short Name: wabt
URL: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt
Version: 1.0.36
Date: 2025-11-19
Update Mechanism: Git submodule
License: Apache 2.0
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: No (build-time tool only)
Security Critical: no
License Android Compatible: yes

Description:
The WebAssembly Binary Toolkit (WABT) is a suite of tools for working with
WebAssembly. This integration specifically uses the wasm2c tool, which
transpiles WebAssembly modules into C code.

This is only used during the build process to generate sandboxed code and is
not shipped with Chromium. The wasm2c runtime sources are compiled into the
sandboxed library.

